WEBVTT

00:00:04.279 --> 00:00:07.412
Okay, Wayne. It's your turn.
Go kill something.
韦恩，到你了，去杀点什么

00:00:07.586 --> 00:00:08.587
Denisovich, watch this.
丹尼斯维奇，看好了

00:00:08.762 --> 00:00:09.893
What?
–去干吗？
–我说过了，快点

00:00:10.067 --> 00:00:11.329
I told you, come on.
–去干吗？
–我说过了，快点

00:00:11.503 --> 00:00:13.201
If we don't
inspire Denisovich,
要是不激一下丹尼斯维奇
他的举止怎么能有个怪物样呢？

00:00:13.375 --> 00:00:15.246
how's he going to
find his inner monster?
要是不激一下丹尼斯维奇
他的举止怎么能有个怪物样呢？

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:16.595
Who's in a monster?
–谁是个怪物？
–没人…

00:00:16.770 --> 00:00:18.206
Nobody, just...
–谁是个怪物？
–没人…

00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:19.207
Here, have an avocado.
给，吃个牛油果

00:00:19.381 --> 00:00:20.643
Yay!
给，吃个牛油果

00:00:20.817 --> 00:00:22.645
Your mommy says
it's a good fat.
你妈妈说它有健康的脂肪
天晓得这是什么意思

00:00:22.819 --> 00:00:24.778
Whatever
the heaven that means.
你妈妈说它有健康的脂肪
天晓得这是什么意思

00:00:24.952 --> 00:00:26.823
Listen, I'm not gonna
set monsters back again
就为了让你的孙子找到吸血鬼的感觉

00:00:26.997 --> 00:00:29.391
just to make your
grandkid like vampires.
我才不会破坏怪物被人类接纳的进程

00:00:29.565 --> 00:00:30.827
Anyway,
there's nothing to kill here.
It's all been...
再说了，这也没什么能杀的，都…

00:00:31.001 --> 00:00:31.915
[TWIGS SNAPPING]
再说了，这也没什么能杀的，都…

00:00:34.962 --> 00:00:36.137
Aw...

00:00:36.311 --> 00:00:37.486
What a cutie.
好可爱

00:00:38.356 --> 00:00:39.923
But kill him.
去杀了他

00:00:40.097 --> 00:00:43.274
Oh, great. You know
I haven't done this in years.
好吧，你们都道我金盆洗手很多年了

00:00:43.448 --> 00:00:46.234
We don't need to kill anymore.
We have Pop-Tarts.
我们不用再开杀戒了，有小圆饼可以吃

00:00:46.408 --> 00:00:48.758
Denisovich,
you're going to love this.
丹尼斯维奇，你会很喜欢这个的

00:00:48.932 --> 00:00:51.630
Wayne's going to
eat that whole deer,
and the next one's yours.
韦恩要吃掉整头鹿，而你去干掉下一头鹿

00:00:51.805 --> 00:00:52.893
Wayne, go.
韦恩，上

00:00:57.636 --> 00:00:59.813
Oh, man. I'm too old for this.
天哪，我早过了干这个的年纪了

00:00:59.987 --> 00:01:02.163
Okay, how's it go again?
好吧，要怎么做来着？

00:01:02.337 --> 00:01:03.686
[HOWLS]
不对，等等，那是有月亮的时候

00:01:03.860 --> 00:01:05.035
No, no, wait.
That's for the moon.
不对，等等，那是有月亮的时候

00:01:05.209 --> 00:01:07.342
Oh, I growl. Right, here goes.
要咆哮，没错，上

00:01:09.518 --> 00:01:10.737
Growl!
–咆哮！
–抓住，孩子

00:01:10.911 --> 00:01:11.781
MAN: Get it, boy.
–咆哮！
–抓住，孩子

00:01:12.477 --> 00:01:13.217
[BARKING]

00:01:14.871 --> 00:01:15.829
[BOTH GROWLING]

00:01:17.613 --> 00:01:19.006
Get it, Uncle Wayne.
快抓住，韦恩叔

00:01:21.573 --> 00:01:25.316
Some werewolf.
Did you actually
say the word "growl?"
差劲的狼人
你真把“咆哮”这个词说出来了？

00:01:25.490 --> 00:01:26.753
You're a werewussy.
–你个胆小鬼
–我说了我很久没做过了

00:01:26.927 --> 00:01:28.232
I said I was rusty.
–你个胆小鬼
–我说了我很久没做过了

00:01:29.973 --> 00:01:31.540
Gimme me that Frisbee.
–把那个飞盘给我
–不给！这是我的！我抓住的！

00:01:31.714 --> 00:01:33.020
No! It's my Frisbee!
I fetched it!
–把那个飞盘给我
–不给！这是我的！我抓住的！

00:01:33.194 --> 00:01:34.717
DRACULA: Give it to me!
Give it back!
给我！还回去！

00:01:34.891 --> 00:01:37.285
Give it over here!
Give me that! Give it back!
拿来！给我！还回去！

00:01:42.986 --> 00:01:44.553
He's fine.
He's Blobby.
他没事，他是斑点

00:01:47.382 --> 00:01:50.167
This place is so
amazing and scenic.
这地方太棒了，好漂亮

00:01:50.341 --> 00:01:51.386
What do you
wanna show me first?
–你要带我从哪开始看？
–不知道

00:01:51.560 --> 00:01:52.779
Mmm. I don't know.
–你要带我从哪开始看？
–不知道

00:01:52.953 --> 00:01:54.258
It's pretty,
but there's really
这很漂亮，可是天一黑
就无事可做了

00:01:54.432 --> 00:01:55.694
nothing to do
once it gets dark.
这很漂亮，可是天一黑
就无事可做了

00:01:55.869 --> 00:01:57.261
Wait. What's that place?
等等，那是什么地方？

00:02:01.831 --> 00:02:03.920
So, you're telling
me that I can pick
你是说，有这么多种类的薯片可以挑？

00:02:04.094 --> 00:02:05.530
between all these
different kinds of chips?
你是说，有这么多种类的薯片可以挑？

00:02:06.444 --> 00:02:07.532
Yes.
对

00:02:07.706 --> 00:02:09.447
How do people decide?
挑哪包是好啊？

00:02:10.187 --> 00:02:11.667
Whoa!
那些五花八门的红水是什么？

00:02:11.841 --> 00:02:14.278
Now what's that
beautiful fountain of rubies?
那些五花八门的红水是什么？

00:02:15.540 --> 00:02:17.412
Johnny,
have you tried this Slurpee?
–约翰尼，你喝过这个思乐冰吗？
–发音有点快，宝贝

00:02:17.586 --> 00:02:19.457
Not that quickly, hon.
–约翰尼，你喝过这个思乐冰吗？
–发音有点快，宝贝

00:02:19.631 --> 00:02:22.896
It comes in 48 flavors.
We have to try them all.
有48种口味，我们都得尝一下

00:02:26.290 --> 00:02:27.901
Uh, I don't know
if we have time.
我不知道时间够不够

00:02:28.075 --> 00:02:30.599
Why? This place is open
all night. Right, sir?
怎么了？
这家店晚上不关门，对吗，先生？

00:02:30.773 --> 00:02:31.600
Yes.
对

00:02:33.123 --> 00:02:34.037
[CHUCKLES]

00:02:36.431 --> 00:02:38.694
Johnny, look.
他们在这拍电视节目呢，我们是明星了

00:02:38.868 --> 00:02:40.827
They're making a TV
show about this place
and we're the stars.
他们在这拍电视节目呢，我们是明星了

00:02:41.001 --> 00:02:42.219
Hello, world.
–这个世界，大家好
–漂亮

00:02:42.393 --> 00:02:44.004
Awesome.
–这个世界，大家好
–漂亮

00:02:44.178 --> 00:02:47.442
It's totally awesome.
You're so lucky, Kal.
太棒了，你太走运了，卡尔

00:02:48.530 --> 00:02:50.010
Hello, world.
这个世界，大家好

00:02:53.622 --> 00:02:55.493
Okay, Murray. Your turn.
好了，穆雷，该你了

00:02:56.973 --> 00:03:00.324
Excuse us.
Do you know where someone
can get a bite around here?
抱歉，这附近哪有东西吃吗？

00:03:00.498 --> 00:03:03.545
Did you seriously
just ask a vampire
where to get a bite?
你当真要问吸血鬼
去哪吃东西？

00:03:03.719 --> 00:03:06.113
Oh, gosh. I didn't mean...
We're not from around here.
哎呀，我不是故意的…
我们不是这附近的人

00:03:06.287 --> 00:03:08.550
This is so embarrassing.
Just keep going.
太丢人了，快开车

00:03:08.724 --> 00:03:10.639
Sorry to bother you.
Love your chocolate cereal.
不好意思打扰了
我很喜欢包装上有你的巧克力麦片

00:03:14.208 --> 00:03:15.992
So, what do you
want me to do now?
你要让我做什么？

00:03:16.166 --> 00:03:17.776
Denisovich,
you won't believe it.
丹尼斯维奇，你都不能相信

00:03:17.951 --> 00:03:20.127
The mummy can
crash through walls
木乃伊可以穿墙
变成很多甲虫

00:03:20.301 --> 00:03:22.085
and turn into
a swarm of beetles
木乃伊可以穿墙
变成很多甲虫

00:03:22.259 --> 00:03:24.435
and put a curse on anyone.
给任何人下诅咒

00:03:24.609 --> 00:03:25.915
That sounds mean.
–听着很残忍
–残忍得有趣，好了

00:03:26.089 --> 00:03:27.482
It's fun mean. Okay.
–听着很残忍
–残忍得有趣，好了

00:03:27.656 --> 00:03:29.876
So, check it out.
注意了

00:03:30.050 --> 00:03:33.792
Murray's going to conjure up
the biggest sandstorm
you've ever seen.
木乃伊要召唤最大号的大风沙
你前所未见

00:03:33.967 --> 00:03:35.533
Hit it!
–开始！
–风沙？这是猴年马月的事了

00:03:35.707 --> 00:03:37.318
Sandstorm?
It's been awhile.
–开始！
–风沙？这是猴年马月的事了

00:03:37.492 --> 00:03:39.320
Not my problem.
Do it. Say your little spell.
–我不管，快点，念你的咒语
–好吧

00:03:39.494 --> 00:03:42.105
Okay.
–我不管，快点，念你的咒语
–好吧

00:03:42.279 --> 00:03:45.935
[SIGHS] I got this.
Frank, Wayne, Griffin,
just try not to faint.
好吧，弗兰克，韦恩，格林芬
别晕倒啊

00:03:51.462 --> 00:03:52.115
[CLEARS THROAT]

00:03:53.377 --> 00:03:55.553
[CHANTING IN FAUX
EGYPTIAN LANGUAGE]

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:07.870
Ow!

00:04:08.044 --> 00:04:09.263
My back.
我的背

00:04:10.090 --> 00:04:11.004
[GROANS]

00:04:14.007 --> 00:04:15.008
[LAUGHING]

00:04:18.402 --> 00:04:19.664
Oh. Wait.
等等

00:04:23.712 --> 00:04:24.321
[BOTH LAUGHING]

00:04:25.018 --> 00:04:25.888
[GRIFFIN LAUGHING]

00:04:26.062 --> 00:04:27.542
How cute!
真可爱！

00:04:27.716 --> 00:04:28.543
[GROANING]

00:04:28.717 --> 00:04:30.371
Ow! Ow!

00:04:34.723 --> 00:04:37.987
Wait. Stop at that playground.
Look at these cute kids.
等等，在这个操场停车
看看这些可爱的孩子们

00:04:40.685 --> 00:04:41.425
[GRUNTING]

00:04:44.733 --> 00:04:47.562
Holy rabies!
This looks like a blast.
天呀！看着太好玩了

00:04:47.736 --> 00:04:49.868
I don't know, Mavey.
你要是门外汉的话
这可是很危险的活动

00:04:50.043 --> 00:04:51.914
This can be pretty dangerous
if you don't know
what you're doing.
你要是门外汉的话
这可是很危险的活动

00:04:52.088 --> 00:04:53.611
Of course, I rock these bikes.
当然了，我玩自行车很有一套

00:04:53.785 --> 00:04:55.091
May I, little dude?
能借我玩下吗，小兄弟？

00:04:55.962 --> 00:04:58.486
Check it out. Oh, yeah.
看好了

00:04:58.660 --> 00:05:00.618
This is how I
rolled every summer.
我小时候，每个夏天都这么玩

00:05:02.707 --> 00:05:04.535
Whoo-hoo!

00:05:04.709 --> 00:05:05.449
Whoa, whoa!

00:05:06.624 --> 00:05:07.321
[SCREAMING]

00:05:12.456 --> 00:05:13.240
[GROANS]

00:05:15.111 --> 00:05:16.373
I think I scratched it.
我想我把它弄坏了

00:05:16.547 --> 00:05:17.461
Oh...

00:05:17.635 --> 00:05:19.855
My turn.
玛维，我跟你说过了
我玩了很多年才有这个水平

00:05:20.029 --> 00:05:22.162
[CHUCKLES] Mavey, I told you,
it took me years
to get this good.
玛维，我跟你说过了
我玩了很多年才有这个水平

00:05:22.336 --> 00:05:24.251
Well, I'll give it a try.
我试试

